ghostsofmars-by-faemiyah (1.0+git20171018-0ddebs9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patches : added 08_enable-vsync.patch, V-Sync is enabled
    after the OpenGL context creation
  * debian/patches/01_adapt_cmake.patch : fixed the target name of the
    MSVC link, the executable is named after the package by CMake
    (OUTPUT_NAME), DEP-3 header
  * debian/patches/07_resizable-window.patch : the drawable size is
    checked every frame, the intro was not centered when started in
    fullscreen (no resize event from SDL2), DEP-3 header
  * debian/rules : removed the mv of the executable in
    override_dh_install and the redundant -DUSE_LD flag
  * debian/control : cmake (>= 3.16), added libgl-dev, longer
    description
  * debian/copyright : upstream name and source, BSD-3-Clause text as in
    the LICENCE file
  * debian/resources/*.desktop : 4k intro comment, French comment and
    keywords
  * debian/source/lintian-overrides : removed the unused source-is-missing
    overrides and the package prefix
  * debian/ghostsofmars-by-faemiyah.lintian-overrides : groff-message of
    the pandoc man page
  * debian/README.Debian, debian/ghostsofmars-by-faemiyah.6.md : updated

 -- Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:44:00 +0100

